# Live game state — every voyage is a fresh one
.meridian/

# The player writes these two files themselves. That's the whole game, so the
# files stay out of the repo and the next person starts with a blank page.
# The FOLDERS are committed (via .gitkeep) so nobody has to mkdir to play.
.claude/skills/distress-triage/*
!.claude/skills/distress-triage/.gitkeep
.claude/agents/hull-sentinel.md

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.gstack/
